    "compressed_frame": "There are A_i in End(U) with sum A_i=I, rank A_i<=dim L_i, rank(A_i^2-A_i)<=k, rank(A_i A_j)<=k, and rank(H_f A_i-A_i^T H_f)<=2k, where k<=s.",
